# What `vercel deploy` from this root leaves out. Vercel builds from source, so local caches, build output and test
# results are never needed (and the caches pass the 100 MB file limit). Local env files stay local.
.turbo
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/node_modules
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
.env*
**/.env*
